{"repositoryId":941777978,"availability":"available","full":"VAST-AI-Research/MIDI-3D","name":"MIDI-3D","description":"[CVPR 2025] MIDI: Multi-Instance Diffusion for Single Image to 3D Scene Generation","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":953,"forks":75,"created":"2025-03-03T03:10:43Z","updated":"2025-06-12T11:45:34Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huanngzh.github.io/MIDI-Page/","topics":["3d","3d-generation","3d-scene","3d-scene-generation"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/VAST-AI/MIDI-3D","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:37.334Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:37.334Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:37.334Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T12:31:37.334Z","stars":953,"forks":75}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MIDI is a 3D generative model for single image to compositional 3D scene generation. Unlike existing methods that rely on reconstruction or retrieval techniques or recent approaches that employ multi-stage object-by-object generation, MIDI extends pre-trained image-to-3D object generation models to multi-instance diffusion models, enabling the simultaneous generation of multiple high-quality 3D instances with accurate spatial relationships and high generalizability."],"features":["High Quality: It produces diverse 3D scenes at high quality with intricate shape.","High Generalizability: It generalizes to real image and stylized image inputs although trained only on synthetic data.","High Efficiency: It generates 3D scenes from segmented instance images, without lengthy steps or time-consuming per-scene optimization."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VAST-AI-Research/MIDI-3D/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e9bd4487ae9cc590d679a97a4e70d1fc597b14ba583a897aa8c036642424efa3","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:37.396Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:37.396Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text"